    "detailed_description": "This is a puzzle game where you (the green node) have to go around the screen and hit switches that are color coded to the different hacker lines coming in. The game starts simple enough, but quickly gets really complicated as more mechanics are added every 5 or so levels. Mechanics (powers, hazards, etc.) never go away. When they are introduced, they will stay for the rest of the game. Get ready for one of the most challenging puzzle games you'll ever play!",
    "about_the_game": "This is a puzzle game where you (the green node) have to go around the screen and hit switches that are color coded to the different hacker lines coming in. The game starts simple enough, but quickly gets really complicated as more mechanics are added every 5 or so levels. Mechanics (powers, hazards, etc.) never go away. When they are introduced, they will stay for the rest of the game. Get ready for one of the most challenging puzzle games you'll ever play!",
    "short_description": "You are being hacked by increasing amounts of hackers who use many different techniques to get in the system. All you need to do is use your abilities to hit all the switches that shut down the ports that the hackers are coming in on. But, watch out, there are many different ways they can successfully hack in.",
